## 1. Introduction

In an ever-evolving educational landscape, understanding the interplay between schools, universities, curricula, and student services is crucial for fostering an effective learning environment. This report draws on data from various educational institutions across the United States, focusing on key players like the National Association of State Boards of Education (NASBE) and the Council for Higher Education Accreditation (CHEA).

## 2. Overview of Educational Institutions

### 2.1 K-12 Schools

The K-12 education system serves students from kindergarten through 12th grade. This segment includes public, private, and charter schools.

